    "title": "Chickasaw County Hires New Conservation Director - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Pitz ,\n19 hours ago Three weeks after Chickasaw County Supervisors accepted the resignation of Chad Humpal as County Conservation Director, his successor is now on the job. During Monday’s (Sept. 28) Supervisors meeting, Joanne Myrsiades with the Conservation Board introduced the new director. Supervisor Jacob Hackman asked Myrsiades about the availability of Humpal... Read full article",
